Z||000000||Formula||07-22-99||09:20 AM||||I went to Amerilube to get a full service on my car and they seemed to like it.  I have 135000 miles and 0000 oil leaks (very proud  moment).  The only thing I needed was winsheild washer fluid.  It only took them 5 mins to change they oil and scrub out the whole system.  I'd have to say its a good deal for 20 bucks. Tey also go through and check-------LIST-TIME----------<br>Lubrication points<br>differential rear<br>air filter<br>breather element<br>wiper blades<br>brake fluid<br>power steering fluid (?????????)hmmmmm....<br>radiator fluid<br>washer fluid<br>lube door handles<br>and tire pressure on all 4<br>..........................<br>But the cool thing is they drool while looking at a 27000 lb car with a 160 HP V6.<br>Just thought I'd mention it.
