Z||000010||Patrick||07-24-99||05:01 PM||||<br>Ok Chris, I can now refer to you by a <b> real</b> name!<p>Nice job of "stealing" my smilie. You've come a long way since the first time you tried to post a graphic image here.<p>I have a suggestion for you regarding your unique oil changing method. Your other family members may not appreciate this, but why don't you put your new oil filter (filled with oil of course) into the deep freeze for a couple of hours before you install it. That way the oil should be thickened up a bit before you have to tip the filter to spin it on. Might cut down on your spillage. Just don't have an accident and spill it in the freezer!<p> <IMG SRC="http://www.ozarksoft.com/ani/fiery.gif"> 
